\begin_inset Formula $f$
\end_inset

,
 is the subset of the codomain every element of which is a mapped element from 
\begin_inset Formula $A$
\end_inset

:
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
f(A)=\{f(x)\mid x:A\}
\]

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Definition
